Description: DANOS add-context-to-send_linkUpDownNotifications.patch, rebased onto net-snmp 5.9.5.2
 Ported to stock kernels: the context comes from the interface's L3 VRF
 master (sysfs master link to a DEVTYPE=vrf device) instead of the Vyatta
 routing-domain kernel's /sys/class/net/<if>/rdid.
Origin: vendor, https://github.com/danos/net-snmp debian/patches

